\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Christ, our saviour and our Lord\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Takes away all of our woes
\par And He through all his sufferings
\par Has redeemed us from our sins.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  And so we take His body
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 On His table as the bread
\par And His blood we drink as wine
\par In remembrance of His death.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Those who come to this table
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Must have themselves examined;
\par That they do not eat and drink
\par To bring curse rather on them.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Praise the Father Almighty
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For this food that He gives you
\par And for the sake of your sins
\par Made Jesus alone for it
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Believe Him your physician
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For your spirit and sickness
\par He Heals all the sinful men
\par That looks for a good Healing.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Search with a good contrite Heart
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 The grace of Jesus and life
\par Hypocrites that they will be
\par Shall receive not a reward.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  Jesus says to the weary
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Come to me for a good rest
\par Those who are strong and healthy
\par Come not to a physician.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.  If you have something so good,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Or that I may have to die?
\par If you have to save yourself
\par then you have to come to him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 9\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 9.  If you believe in your heart
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And you proclaim by your mouth
\par Then you are fit for the place
\par And your soul shall be so full.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 10\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  10.  Love your neighbour as your self
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and go forth to bear good fruits;
\par so that what I have made you
\par \pard    do the same to your neighbour. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

